      <div class="picker">
        <span class="picker-label">Preview a sample pet</span>
        <div class="chips" data-chips id="pets">
          <button class="chip" type="button" data-value="golden" aria-pressed="true"><img src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/img/pet-golden.jpg" alt="">Golden</button>
          <button class="chip" type="button" data-value="tabby" aria-pressed="false"><img src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/img/pet-tabby.jpg" alt="">Tabby</button>
          <button class="chip" type="button" data-value="collie" aria-pressed="false"><img src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/img/pet-collie.jpg" alt="">Collie</button>
          <button class="chip" type="button" data-value="frenchie" aria-pressed="false"><img src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/img/pet-frenchie.jpg" alt="">Frenchie</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% render 'wt-buy', product: product %}
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li>Upload your pet's photo above, or email it after checkout</li>
        <li>Art proof within 24 hours, with up to 2 free changes</li>
        <li>Woven and shipped in the USA, about 4–7 business days after you approve</li>
        <li>Order by Dec 10 for Christmas delivery</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" style="padding-bottom: 24px">
    <dl class="label-strip reveal">
      <div><dt>Fiber</dt><dd>100% cotton</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Construction</dt><dd>Jacquard woven</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Size</dt><dd>approx. 52 × 37 in</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Tolerance</dt><dd>± 2.5 in</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Edges</dt><dd>Fringed ends</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Care</dt><dd>Cold wash, gentle</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap stack" style="gap: 2.5rem">
    <div class="stack reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2>Four steps, <em>one photo.</em></h2></div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="reveal"><h3>Order</h3><p class="muted">Pick your art style and check out.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><h3>Send a photo</h3><p class="muted">Upload a clear photo of your pet's face, or reply to our email with it. Phone photos are perfect.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><h3>Approve the art</h3><p class="muted">We send the illustration within 24 hours. Ask for up to 2 changes, free.</p></li>
      <li class="reveal"><h3>We weave &amp; ship</h3><p class="muted">Woven in the USA and delivered with tracking in about 4–7 business days.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top: 0">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="frame reveal" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5"><img src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/img/blanket-weave-closeup.jpg" alt="Close-up of woven threads and fringe" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="stack reveal" style="gap: 1.4rem">
        <span class="eyebrow">Woven, not printed</span>
        <h2>The picture is made of <em>thread.</em></h2>
        <p class="lede">On a jacquard blanket the loom lifts colored cotton threads to build the image, so the portrait is part of the fabric, not ink on top of it.</p>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="compare">
            <thead><tr><th></th><th>Woven (ours)</th><th>Typical printed fleece</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Image</td><td>Formed by the threads</td><td>Printed onto the surface</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Fiber</td><td>100% cotton</td><td>Usually polyester</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Texture</td><td>Visible weave, fringed ends</td><td>Smooth, plush</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Best artwork</td><td>Bold, simple illustration</td><td>Any photo</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="note">That's why we illustrate your photo first: bold shapes weave beautifully, while very fine details like single whiskers get simplified.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap stack" style="gap: 2rem; padding-top: 0">
    <div class="stack reveal"><span class="eyebrow">At home</span><h2>Sofa, bed or <em>under the tree.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <figure class="reveal"><div class="frame" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5"><img src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/img/blanket-tree-collie.jpg" alt="Christmas-style collie blanket under a tree" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>Christmas scarf style · illustration of the product</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="reveal"><div class="frame" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5"><img src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/img/blanket-bed-tabby.jpg" alt="Royal-style cat blanket on a bed with the cat" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>Royal style · illustration of the product</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top: 0">
    <div class="split flip">
      <div class="reels" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr))">
        <div class="frame reveal"><video data-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/video/1A-photo-to-blanket.jpg" src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/video/1A-photo-to-blanket.mp4" aria-label="Photo to illustration to woven blanket"></video></div>
        <div class="frame reveal"><video data-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/video/1C-pick-a-style.jpg" src="https://woven-tails.vercel.app/video/1C-pick-a-style.mp4" aria-label="One cat shown in three art styles"></video></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack reveal" style="gap: 1.2rem">
        <span class="eyebrow">Made for gifting</span>
        <h2>For the person with <em>400 dog photos</em> on their phone.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Dog moms, cat dads, grandparents of furry grandkids, and anyone keeping a pet's memory close.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="#create" style="justify-self: start">Create mine · $64</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap split" style="padding-top: 0; align-items: start">
    <div class="stack reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions</span><h2>Before you order.</h2></div>
    <div class="faq reveal">
      <details><summary>What photo should I send?</summary><p>A clear, well-lit photo of your pet's face with the eyes visible. Phone photos work well. Send 2–3 if you can.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will it look exactly like my photo?</summary><p>It's an illustration of your pet, not a photo. We keep their real markings, colors and expression in a bold style that weaves well, and you approve it before anything is made.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is the art made with AI?</summary><p>Yes. We use AI-assisted illustration, then check every image by hand against your photo and fix anything that's off.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you add my pet's name?</summary><p>Yes. Type it in the name box above and we'll weave it under the portrait.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I don't like it?</summary><p>You get up to 2 free art changes before production. If the finished blanket arrives damaged or doesn't match the approved art, we replace it free.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I return it?</summary><p>Because it's made just for you, we can't take change-of-mind returns. Anything wrong with it gets a free replacement or a refund.</p></details>
      <details><summary>When will it arrive?</summary><p>About 4–7 business days after you approve the art. Order by Dec 10 for Christmas delivery in the US.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap" style="padding-top: 0">
    <div class="band reveal">
      <div class="stack"><h2>Their face, <em>in cotton.</em></h2><p>$64 · free US shipping · art proof in 24 hours</p></div>
      <a class="btn" href="#create">Create mine</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<div class="buybar"><div><strong>$64</strong> <span class="muted">· woven blanket</span></div><a class="btn small" href="#create">Create mine</a></div>
<script type="module">
  import { initBlanket } from "https://woven-tails.vercel.app/theme-assets/wt-scenes.js";
  const state = { pet: "golden", style: "pop" };
  try {
    const b = initBlanket(document.getElementById("blanket-stage"), { base: "https://woven-tails.vercel.app/tex/", art: "golden-pop" });
    const apply = () => b.setArt(`${state.pet}-${state.style}`);
    document.getElementById("pets").addEventListener("pick", (e) => { state.pet = e.detail; apply(); });
    document.addEventListener("wt:style", (e) => { state.style = e.detail; if (!state.user) apply(); });
    document.addEventListener("wt:art", (e) => { state.user = true; b.setArtURL(e.detail); });
    document.addEventListener("wt:design", (e) => { state.user = true; b.setArtURL(e.detail, true); });
    document.addEventListener("wt:theme", (e) => b.setFringe(e.detail.fringe));
    document.getElementById("pets").addEventListener("pick", () => { state.user = false; });
  } catch (err) { console.warn("3D preview unavailable", err); }
</script>
